// ID: GCI-KQL-AST-001
// Title: Software inventory review for vulnerability triage
// Platform: Microsoft Defender Vulnerability Management / Sentinel
// Type: Inventory pivot (not a CVE exposure determination)
// Data source: DeviceTvmSoftwareInventory
// Required fields: DeviceName, SoftwareVendor, SoftwareName, SoftwareVersion, EndOfSupportStatus
// Maturity: Draft — confirm licensing, table availability and exact affected-version ranges
// Source: reports/2026/11/22.md
// ATT&CK: Not applicable; asset inventory query.
// False positives: Duplicate product records, stale inventory and vendor naming differences.
// Tuning: Join to authoritative CVE affected-version ranges and asset exposure/criticality; do not infer vulnerability from vendor name alone.

DeviceTvmSoftwareInventory
| where SoftwareVendor has_any ("VMware", "Apache", "Cisco", "SAP")
| project DeviceName, SoftwareVendor, SoftwareName,
          SoftwareVersion, EndOfSupportStatus
| order by SoftwareVendor asc, SoftwareName asc
